WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.250
The layer is covered with a light-sensitive material.

00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:10.150
Light marks which part of the coating will change.

00:00:10.150 --> 00:00:16.000
The remaining coating protects the areas that should stay.

00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:21.250
The same circuit repeats across the wafer.

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:26.150
An electrical test checks which ones work.

00:00:26.150 --> 00:00:32.000
A yield of 75 percent means 75 of the 100 chips work.
